{"id":"vod_bf_140201","vodId":"140201","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"吃魔物的冒险者","name_cn":"吃魔物的冒险者","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260403-1/a494f8d00e42d47e79b980c9d675d560.webp"},"summary":"E级冒险者路德。他唯一的技能“异常状态无效化”，在充满瘴气的迷宫中采集药草时，除了采集外几乎毫无用处的鸡肋存在。战斗能力近乎为零，被冒险者同伴们戏称为“瘴气渔夫”。甚至被人讥讽为“饭桶”。为了打破这种现状，路德决定挑战新的迷宫，却遭到同伴背叛而遇险。物资耗尽濒临死亡之际，他毅然决定吞食被视为禁忌的魔物血肉——然而路德不断吞噬魔物获取新技能的“魔物吞噬者”冒险传奇，就此展开！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-19 09:16:06","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/chimowudemaoxianzhe/26048081f125/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/chimowudemaoxianzhe/22e008ee4c65/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/chimowudemaoxianzhe/c8c1798e8182/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/chimowudemaoxianzhe/3cd7d5e9dafc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/chimowudemaoxianzhe/eb2c2fd83d55/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/chimowudemaoxianzhe/e642811496af/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/chimowudemaoxianzhe/d33a4c3af7d3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/chimowudemaoxianzhe/3c18a3b8ca14/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/chimowudemaoxianzhe/6c0d5ef216ad/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/chimowudemaoxianzhe/139da32cce17/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/chimowudemaoxianzhe/e79dfef3339b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://bfeng10.com/video/chimowudemaoxianzhe/81ef93c815e1/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:20.446Z"}